<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Yakobu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kihitabu haki kiyandikwa na mundu mmonga mweni kukemwa Yakobu. Inguwesekana yiwa pangi Yakobu awelile mlongo ghaki Yesu Kilisito, awelili ni kilongosi kulipinga lyeni kumkwinila Kilisito lya dahile, na awelile mjumbi wa njengakaya kihitabu kya Matendu gha Wandumindumi sula gha 15:13. Mndumindumi Paulo hilahila amkemili Yakobu “mghomba” wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito Kihitabu kya Wagalatia Sula gha 2:9. Wasomi wangukwinila yiwa kihitabu kya Yakobu kiyandikilwi pambila gha machuva gha iamsini badili gha kuweleka Kilisito. Kwaikiva Yakobu awelile kilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito haku Yelusalemu ingukwinulwa yiwa ayandikili kihitabu haki paawelile haku Yelusalemu kwaikiva awelile akilikala haku ku Yelusalemu. Yakobu ayandikile kihitabu haki kwa makabila ikumi na ivili yeni yapwililikile kumlimawogha Sula gha mtumbulo 1:1. Mavulo yenikuwela kukihitabu kya Yakobu ni ghamaha kwa wakwinila wogha, ila lilando “Likabila ikumi na ivili” lingughola tumanyi yiwa pangi Yakobu awayandikilile Wayahudi wamkwinilile Kilisito. Kwaikiva kihitabu haki lukani luwelile kuwahikila wasoma watangala. Lukasini lya Yakobu ni kulola matendu na kukwinila. Kukwinila kwa chakaka kungulangiha kumatendu Sula gha 2:17. Kangi awakalipilili wandu kwa kitendu kya kuvika ubaghula kwa wanaisa Sula gha 2:1-4 atulongelile kunani gha kulikala mihu na ghala tunguyalongela Sula gha 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobu anguwajambusa wasoma ghaki kusula gha 1:1</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu anguwataya moyu weni kumkwinila Kilisito kusula gha 1:2-27</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi anguhimulila vila ingupalwa kukwinila kulangilwi kwa matendu ku Sula gha 2:1-6</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu anguhimulila kunani gha milando inguwela na makakala kusula gha 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi anguhimulila vila luhala lwa Sapanga paluwela na mlekano na luhala lwa wandu kusula gha 3:13-4:10</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu angukalipila vilongosi ghaki kunani gha habali gha kulidumba 4:11-20</para>
  <para style="io">Mwihu Yakobu anguyomola kihitabu kyaki kwa kuwapegha malaghilo gha kuwela na umonga 5:7-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Nenga Yakobu, mtumikila wa Sapanga na mtumikila wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">ninguwayandikila makabila ikumi na ivili weni kulandala kumlima wogha. Jambu.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukwinila na kulikala kwa luhala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Walongo wa nenga mhekeleli pamkolwa na lung'ai lwa wekaweka, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />kwaikiva mngumanya yiwa kukwinila kwa mwenga pakunguyeswa kunguwayeghela mwenga kufumilila. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Hinu myendeleli kufumilila mbaka mwihu, ili mpati kutimila bila kulepelelwa na kindu chochosi. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Paikawela mmonga wa mwenga kalepelelwa na luhala, hayu angupalwa kumyupa Sapanga mwenikuwapegha wondu wogha mweni atempegha mundu hayu luhala bila kukalipila. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ila angupalwa kuyupa kwa kukwinila bila kutila yiwa atepokela au atepokela ng'ogha, kwaikiva mundu mwenikuwela na holu angulandana na liwimbi lya bahali lyeni kuhukumulwa haku na haku kwa liyegha. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Hinu mundu handa hayu akotoho kuliwachila yiwa atepokela chochosi angukiyupa kuhuma kwa Bambu. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Kwaikiva kakola mawachilo maivili, na mweni kughalambuka ghalambuka kundyangilu ghaki.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukapuku na unaisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Mlongo mwenikukwinila pakawela mkapuku angupalwa ahekeleli kwaikiva Sapanga angumlola yiwa ni mundu mweni kutundamilwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Mnaisa hilahila angupalwa ahekeleli kwa kuhuluswa na Sapanga. Kwaikiva atelaghalika handa uluwa wa kulitawa, <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />atelaghalika kwaikiva lijuwa likalipa linguhomola na kuyumisa mahamba na uluwa unguguwa pahi, na umaheli ghaki wogha unguyalamika. Hinu mnaisa na mweni ateyalamiswa lipindi paanguwela kumahengu ghaki.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sapanga kangumyesa ng'ogha mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Kahighilwa mundu yula mweni kufumilila mayeso, kwaikiva pakayomola kufumilila, atepeghwa hupo gha ukomu hila Sapanga awalongilile yiwa atewapegha wala weni kumpala. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Mundu paanguyeswa agholi uhakata akotoho kulonga yiwa, “Anguyeswa na Sapanga.” Kwaikiva Sapanga kanguwesa ng'ogha kuyeswa na mahakata na mweni hilahila kanguwesa ng'ogha kumyesa mundu yeyosi kwa mahakata. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Ila mundu anguyeswa paangukweghwa na kuwomela na lumatamata lwaki mweni luhakata, <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Lipindi lumatamata hali palikomala lingumghola mundu agholi sambi, na sambi paikamala inguyambusa kihu. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Walongo wa nenga wapalwa, mkotoho kungongwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Kila kindu kyeni kupeghwa na kya maha na kitimila, kinguhuma kunani, kinguhuma kwa Tati mlumba wa miyengi, mwenikuwela kangughalambuka ng'ogha. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Kwa kupala mweni atulelili kwa lilando lyaki lya chakaka, ili tuweli handa masau gha mtumbulo paghati gha viumbi ghaki.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhyoghanila na kughola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Walongo wa nenga mviki hali kumutu, kila mundu aweli myuyughu pakuyughanila ila aweli mtopa pakulongela, na mtopa pakuhyoma, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />kwaikiva mundu mweni lilaka kanguwesa ng'ogha kutimilisa mapalo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Hinu mleki mighalu hyogha mihakata, na mpokeli kwa kunyenyekela mavulo yakulililwi kumioyu gha kwaikiva yeni ndiwa yenikuwesa kuwalokola. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Mkotoho kulingonga mwaweni kwa kuhyoghanila weka lilando lyaki, ila muweli mngughola handa lilando vila lingulonga. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Mundu yeyosi mweni kuhyoghanila na akaleka kughola kila kakihyoghanila, hayu angulandana na mundu yula mweni kutama na kuilola mweni kukiou. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Hayu anguilola mweni na kumwihu anguyenda zyaki, na bwitu anguisemwa vila kawela. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ila yula mweni kulolesa kwa utali laghilo lya Sapanga lyeni kutimila, lila lyeni kuyegha upekesu, na akaleka kuisemwa kila akihyoghanilile, ila akakighola, atehighilwa kukila angukighola. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Handa kuwela na mundu mwenikuilola yiwa kana njila gha kumyupa Sapanga vila ingupalwa na akaleka kukanisa lulimi lwaki, hayu anguingonga mweni, na njila ghaki gha kumyupa Sapanga ingumtanga ng'ogha chochosi. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Ila mundu mweni kumyupa Sapanga vila ingupalwa angupalwa kughola hagha, kuwatanga weni kuhovilwa na wahumbu kukila walepelelwa na tukotoho kuleka mlima wogha hau utugholi tuweli wahakata.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Mleki kuwabaghula wandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Walongo wa nenga, kwa vila mumkwinila Bambu Yesu Kilisito, Bambu wa ukulu, katu mkotoho kuwabaghula wandu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Paikahumila mundu mmonga mweni kuvala peti gha sahabu na nguu zya maheli anguyingila kukonganiko lya mwenga, hilahila akayingila mundu mkapuku mweni kuvala nguu zihakala, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />na mwenga mkampokela kwa utundamilu yula mweni kuvala nguu maheli na kumlongela, “Utami haku mahala maheli,” ila yula mweni kuvala nguu zihakala mkamlongela, “Wenga ugholoki pala, au utami haku pahi pabehi na maghulu ghangu,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Ghuli, mghalu hau ungulangiha ng'ogha yiwa mngubaghula? Na kwa kughola nagha mngulongoswa ng'ogha na mawachilo mahakata? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Walongo ghangu wapalwa, mhyoghanili huti! Sapanga kawahaghula wakapuku wa mlima wogha hau lukani waweli wanaisa kukukwinila, na weni wapokeli Unkosi hula Sapanga alongile yiwa atewapegha wandu weni kumpala. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ila mwenga munguwapughanya wakapuku. Ghuli, hagha wanaisa ng'ogha ndiwa weni kuwapokola vindu vya mwenga na kuwabuluta kunjenga kaya wakawasitaki? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ghuli, ng'ogha weni kulilighu lihina maheli lya Bambu wa mwenga mkemilwi? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Mtewela mngughola maheli handa mtewela mngutimilisa laghililo maha liyandikilwi kumayandiko gha Sapanga, “Umpali myako handa vila unguipala umweni,” mtewela mghola maheli. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ila paikawela mngubaghula wandu, mngughola sambi, na laghilo linguwalamula mwenga yiwa mungukosela. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ningulonga nagha kwaikiva yeyosi mweni kukola laghilo lyogha, kunu akakosela hata monga hela atewela katenyula malaghilo hyogha, <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />kwaikiva yula mweni kulongela, “Ukotoho kughola ngongola,” ndiwa yulayula Sapanga mwenikulongela, “Ukotoho kukoma.” Hinu paikawela ungughola ng'ogha ngongola ila ungukoma, unguwela mtenyula laghilo. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Hinu, mngulongela na kughola handa wandu wala watetoswa kupitila laghilo lila lyeni kuyegha upekesu, <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />kwaikiva Sapanga atewela ng'ogha na luhungu, pala paatemtosa mundu yula mwenikuwela ng'ogha na luhungu. Ila hata kweni utoso Sapanga anguwawonela wandu luhungu.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukwinila na kughola vila angupala Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Walongo wa nenga, kuwela na fwaida liki paikawela mundu angulongela kangukwinila kunu kangulangiha ng'ogha vitendu vya kukwinila. Ghuli kukwinila haku kunguwesa kumlokola? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Paikawela mhacha au mhaja kahakala nguu au kahela mulyo, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />mmonga wa mwenga akamlongela, “Sapanga aweli pamonga na wenga!” Hai ingumtanga niki? Paumpegha ng'ogha kindu kya kumtanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Havi ndiwa iwela kukwinila weka ghaki pakukonganika ng'ogha na matendu, kuhova. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Paakahumila mundu mtenu akalonga, “Inguwesekana kuwela na kukwinila ukaleka kughola matendu.” Ninguwesa kuyanga, “Unihighilisili vila uwela na kukwinila bila matendu, na nenga nitehighilisa vila niwela na kukwinila pamonga na matendu.” <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Ungukwinila yiwa kuwela na Sapanga mmonga. Ungughola maheli! Ila mahoka yangukwinila kuwela na Sapanga mmonga na kangi yanguhighimila kwa holu nesu. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Wenga msihisihi! Ghuli, ungupala kulangilwa ukwinila ughola ng'ogha lihengu yiwa uhova? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Ghuli, mbuyi wa twenga Abulahamu ajumililwi ng'ogha na Sapanga kwa njila gha matendu ghaki? Mweni amuhumisili mwana ghaki Isaka aweli litambiku kunani gha kihanja. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Kupitila hali unguwesa kulola vila kukwinila kugholile lihengu pamonga na matendu ghaki, hinu kukwinila kwaki kukatimiliswa kupitila matendu ghaki. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ndiwa yakatimila mayandiko gha Sapanga, “Abulahamu amkwinilile Sapanga, na kwa kukwinila haku akagholwa kuwela kajumilwa na Sapanga,” na kwaikiva gha nagha akakemwa ghanja wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Hinu mnguwesa kuilolela yiwa mundu kanguwesa kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa matendu ghaki na ng'ogha kwa kukwinila weka ghaki. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Hilahila hai ihumilile kwa Rahabu yula mngongola, ajumiliwi na Sapanga kwa matendu ghaki, lipindi paawapokela wajumbi weni kulaghilwa na Musa kulolesa na kuwahumisa kupitila njila ghangi. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Hinu, handa vila mhigha bila mpumulo uhova, hilahila kukwinila bila matendo uhova.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Kulongosa lulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Walongo wa nenga paghati gha mwenga kukotoho kuwela na wavula watangala, kwaikiva mngumanya yiwa twenga wavula tutetoswa nesu kupiti waghangi. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Twenga wogha tungukosela mighalu itangala. Pakukawela na mundu kakosela ng'ogha kughala angulongela, hayu katimila, hayu kanguwesa kulikanisa mweni mhigha ghaki ukotoho kulonga mahakata. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Patuvika vipandi vya kyuma kinung'una kyeni kuwopwa ngowi pamlomo wa falasi tungupala atuyitikili, na kwa njila hai tunguwesa kumlongosa kokosi kula tungupala ayendi, <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />au uloli hilahila whato ngulu pamonga na yiwa ingutolwa na liyegha likalipa, ila inguyendeswa na usukani msokombi nesu, kokosi kula angupala ayendi myendesa whato. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Hilahila lulimi ni kikongonu kisokombi nesu kumhigha, ila wandu wanguwesa kuidumba yiwa lughola mighalu mikulunga nesu. Uliwachilile vila mhitu mkulu unguwesa kunyaywa na lyoto lisokombi hela. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Lulimi ni handa lyoto lisokombi, lumema mahakata ngenju, na lweni ni paghati gha vikongonu vya twenga, na lweni ndiwa lyeni kubyodosa mhigha wogha, kangi lulimi ni handa lyoto lyeni kunyanya mundu na kumyalamisa kungalilu ghaki hyogha kulyoto lyeni kuhuma kumambi. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Mundu anguwesa kufuga mfughu wa mbongu, na ndambu weka weka gha mikokolu, mikokolu yeni kukwava na mikokolu gha mbahali. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Ila kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kufuga lulimi. Lulimi ni kindu kihakata, kinguwesa ng'ogha kugholokelwa, na kimema sumu yeni kukoma. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Twenga tungutumila lulimi kumshukwile Bambu na Tati wa twenga. Hila hila kupitila lulimi twenga tunguwalongela wandu wahumilwi na mahakata wandu, wandu weni kulumbwa kwa mlandano wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Milando gha kuhighila na milando gha kutakila wandu mahakata kuhuma kumlomu mmonga, walongo wa nenga hai maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ghuli, uhimbuko mmonga unguwesa kuhumisa masi maheli na masi yeni munyu? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Walongo wa nenga, ghuli, libiki lya mkuyu linguwesa kulela liembi? Au, libiki lya miembi linguwesa kulela matungula gha mkuyu? Uhimbuki wa masi gha munyu unguwesa ng'ogha kuhumisa masi maheli.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala lihumile kwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ghani mweni luhala na umanyi paghati gha mwenga? Alangihi luhala lwaki kwa ngalilu ghaki maha, kwa matendu ghaki yagholilwe kwa unyenyekela weni kuyeghwa na luhala. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ila paikawela mioyu gha mwenga imema na lumatamata luhakata na kuipala umweni, mkotoho kuitutumula kwa kulongela uhwangi mkilonga yiwa ni chakaka. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Luhala lwa ndambu hai lunguhuma ng'ogha kwa Sapanga, ila ni lwa kimundu na lwa Lihyukana, <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />kwaikiva pala penikuwela na wifu na kuipala umweni, ndiwa kwenikuwela na mikologhanyiko pamonga na matendu mahakata. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ila luhala lwa Sapanga kuhuma kundumba ingutughola tuweli ng'ogha na ndaka kuulongolo gha Sapanga, na tuweli na upongu kwa wandu, weni ni wanyalinyali, yeni inguniwesa kuhyoghanila milando gha wandu waghangi, ingunighola niweli mnyenyekela, ingunighola niweli na luhungu na matendu gha maha, nikotoho kuwela mbaghula, na kangi nikotoho kuwela mmbindingu. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Wandu weni kughola ndulumu paghati gha wandu, wanguwela handa wakulila mbeyu gha kulikala kwa kuponga, kuulongolo watebena ghala ghala wangupalwa kubena kuulongolo gha Sapanga.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuupala mlima wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Kindu liki kinguyambusa matovano na magombi mghati gha mwenga? Ghuli, hagha yanguyambuswa ng'ogha na lumatamata lweni kuhuma mghati gha mwenga lweni kusindana mghati gha mwenga? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Mngupala muweli na vindu ila mpata ng'ogha, hinu mngukoma na mnguwela na wifu kwa wandu waghangi, ila mmbila kuhumilwa na ghala mnguyapala, hinu mnguwela na magombi na kutovana. Walongo wa nenga mpata ng'ogha vila mnguvipala kwaikiva mnguyupa ng'ogha kuhuma kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Pamyupa mpata ng'ogha kwaikiva mnguyupa kwa lukani luhakata, ili mpati kuvitumila vila mtepokela kwa lumatamata lula muwela nalu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Mwenga wandu weni kuwela ng'ogha wachakaka handa wangongola, mngumanya ng'ogha yiwa kuupala mlima wogha ni kumhyomela Sapanga? Yeyosi mweni kuighola mghanja wa mlima wogha kanguighola mweni kuwela mhakata wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Mkotoho kuliwachila yiwa kwahela uchakaka kumayandiko gha Sapanga yeni kulonga, “Mpumulo yula mweni kuvikwa na Sapanga mghati gha twenga kana wifu mkulu.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ila Sapanga katulangiha twenga umaha nesu, Hai ndiwa kwaikiva gha kuwela kwa liyandiko lya Sapanga lingulonga, “Sapanga angungingamana na weni kinyengu, ila wanyenyekela anguwahighila.” <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Hinu mumyitikili Sapanga. Mumngingami Lihyukana, na lyeni litetuwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Mumhikili pabehi Sapanga, na mweni atewahikila mwenga pabehi, mwenga weni sambi mleki kughola mahakata, mwenga weni mawaqchilo maivili maivili mleki na mgholi ghamaha. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Mlumbilili na kulila! Kiheku kya mwenga na kihyuki kuwela malumbililo, na luheku lya mwenga lihyuswi kuwela kulila. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Mumyitikili Bambu, na mweni atewayinula.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkotoho kutosa kiuhakata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Walongo, mkotoho kulongelana milando mihakata au kutosana. Yula mweni kumlongela myaki mahakata au kumtosa, hayu angulitosa laghilo na paughola nagha, hinu ungulikola ng'ogha laghilo ila uwela mtosa wa laghilo hali. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Sapanga weka yaki ndiwa mweni kuvika laghilo na kutosa. Ni mweni weka ghaki mweni uwesa wa kulokola na kuyalamisa. Ghuli wenga kwa ghani hata umlongeleli maha ng'ogha myaku?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mleki kuidumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Hinu mwenga weni kulongela “Lelo au kilau tuteyenda kummbwani mtenu na kulikala haku lichuva lyogha tukighola biasala na kupokela fwaida.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Mwenga mngumanya ng'ogha hata vila ngalilu gha mwenga itewela kilau! Mwenga ni handa ukungweta weni kuhumila kwa lipindi lihupi weka na kuulongolo likahuka kangi. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Mngalipalwa kulongela, “Bambu akipala tutelikala na tuteghola haki au kila.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ila hinaa munguisifila na kuliyinula, kulidumba kwa nagha kwa maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Hinu mundu mweni kumanya kughola mighalu maha na akaleka kughola, hayu angughola sambi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Makaniso kwa wanaisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Hinaa mhyoghanili mwenga wanaisa! Mlili na kulumbilila kwaikiva gha lung'ai lula lutewahikila. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Unaisa wa mwenga uwola, na nguu zya mwenga zitahunwa na ng'ongolo mweni kukemwa mmehe. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Sahabu na feza zya mwenga vilyeghwa na kutu, Na kutu hai ndiwa itewasitaki, na yeni iteyalamisa mihigha gha mwenga handa lyoto vila linguyalamisa. Kwaikiva mlikungulila vindu vitangala kumachuwa hagha gha mwihu. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Munguwahipa ng'ogha lihomosi watumikila wala wagholile lihengu kumatawa gha mwenga. Myughanili vila lihomosi lyao lingulalama! Kililo kya wala wabenili kumatawa gha mwenga kimhikila Bambu wa watovangondo. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Mulikala na kuhekelela unaisa wa mwenga mkulu kumlimawogha hau, mwenga muwela na mahuta kwaikiva gha lichuwa lya utoso handa likokolo lyeni kuwela na mahuta lyeni kuyandalwa kuhinjwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Muwatosa na kuwakoma wandu wawela ng'ogha na mahakata, Na weni wawangingamili ng'ogha.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumilila kumahakilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Hinu walongo wa nenga, mfumilili mbaka kuhika kwa Bambu lihanja lya ipili. Mumloli mtukutula vila angulindila masau ghaki yeni umaha yakuli kulutupi. Anguyalindila kwa luhujulu mbaka yapati ndonya zya mtumbulo na mwihu. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Mwenga hilahila mngupalwa mfumilili. Mgangamali kumoyu, kwaikiva kuhika kwa Bambu kwa pabehi. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Walongo wa nenga mkotoho kung'ungulikilana, mkayambusa kutoswa. Mtosa kapabehi kuhika. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Walongo wa nenga mgholi handa walota wa Sapanga wailongile yala Bambu kawalongela walonge, weni wakolilwi na maghasu matangala ila wafumilili. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Tunguwakema wandu hagha yiwa wahighilwa, kwaikiva wafumilili. Myoghanila kala habali gha ufumilifu wa Ayubu, na mngumanya vila Bambu kamgholela kumwihu. Kwaikiva Bambu kamema luhungu na umaha. <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Pamonga na hagha hyogha walongo wa nenga, mkotoho kulapa kwa kundumba au kwa mlima wogha, hata kwa kindu kighangi chochosi. Mlongi “Ndiwa” iweli mngumanisa ndiwa, na mlongi ng'ogha iweli mngumanisa ng'ogha, na kwa hali mtetoswa ng'ogha na Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Mundu wa mwenga pakawoneka na lung'ai na amyupi Sapanga. Pakawoneka na moyu wa kuhekelela, ayimbi uyimbu wa kumsifila Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Hilahila pakawoneka anguvina, angupalwa kuwakema wagogolo wa lipinga lya weni kumkwinila Kilisito. Na weni watemuyupila na kumpakala mahuta kwa lihina lya Bambu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Handa mtekwinila mvina atelamiswa. Bambu atemlamisa, na handa uvina ghaki uhika kwa kughola sambi atehumisilwa sambi. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Hinu mlipetuli mwenga kwa mwenga, na myupilani ili mpati kulamiswa. Kwaikiva kuyupa kwa mundu mwenikughola yeni kumhekelesa Sapanga ghamaha nesu na ingughola matangala kuhumila. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Mlota wa Sapanga Elia awelili mundu handa twenga, ayupili kwa kuyangala ndonya ikotoho kutonya, na yeni ikaleka kutonya kwa lipindi lya machuva miitatu na miei isita. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Kuulongolo akaluwa kangi, ndonya ikatonya na mlima ukamelesa masau. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Walongo wa nenga, yeyosi paghati gha mwenga pakabyodoka na kuleka kukwinila, na mghangi akamuhuyisa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />mmanyi yiwa, hayu mweni kumuhuyisa mweni sambi, kuhuma kunjila ghaki ihakata atelokola mpumulo wa hayu mweni sambi kuhuma kukihu na Sapanga atemlekesela sambi syaki sitangala.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>